
    Within the complex you will find resources which may be used to build
or make certain items.  Your skill at construction and the availability
of resources will determine which items you may build.  Note that certain
items require knowledge of other areas to construct.  For example, a bomb
requires some knowledge of heavy weapons to construct.


Item               Argument       Skill Req. Item Requirements
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ ~~~~~~~~~~ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
DOOR               Direction      Low        1 construction kit
WALL               Direction      Low        1 construction kit
LADDER             None           Low        1 construction kit
ROCKET             None           Low-Medium 1 explosives, 1 weapon parts,
                                             5 secs rocket fuel
ROCKET LAUNCHER    None           Medium     2 weapon parts
TELEPORTER         None           Med-High   2 machine parts, 4 battery packs
BOMB               None           Med-High   2 explosives
SHIELD             None           High       1 weapon parts, 1 machine parts,
                                             3 battery packs
REACTOR            None           High       4 construction kits,
                                             8 machine parts
SLEEP              None           Very High  4 construction kits,
                                             4 machine parts
MEDICAL            None           Very High  4 construction kits,
                                             4 machine parts

Example syntax: build door e
                build wall u
                build ladder

Note that doors and walls may not be built anywhere; it would be
inappropriate, for example, to build a wall in the middle of a hallway.
Experiment to discover where you may build and where you may not.

